    ['falna-railway-station-to-bera-how-to-travel', 'Falna Railway Station to Bera: How to Travel and What It Costs in Time', 'Planning', 'jawai-hills-view', 'The nearest main-line station to Bera and the simplest ways to cover the last 37 km.', 'Falna Station to Bera & Jawai: How to Travel', 'Travelling by train to Jawai? Falna station is about 37 km from Bera. Learn how to arrange a taxi, what to expect on the road and how to plan arrival times.', 'Falna to Bera, Falna railway station Jawai, train to Jawai, Falna to Jawai distance, Jawai by train', 'Falna is a main-line station on the Delhi to Ahmedabad route and the most convenient rail stop for many travellers heading to Bera.', [['Distance and time', 'Falna is about 37 km from Bera, roughly 45 minutes by road. Plan extra time for trains that run late.'], ['Getting a vehicle', 'Arrange a taxi in advance. Message us your train number and arrival time on [WhatsApp](contact) and we can help.'], ['Planning arrival', 'If you arrive late at night, stay in Bera and begin the safari the next morning. Early arrival gives a relaxed day.'], ['Waiting at the station', 'Falna is a small station with basic facilities. Carry water and snacks. If your train is late, message us so we can adjust the pickup.'], ['Onward plans', 'From Bera you can combine the safari with Ranakpur and Kumbhalgarh. See [how to reach Jawai](blog/how-to-reach-jawai-from-udaipur-jodhpur-jaipur).'], ['Safety and comfort', 'If you arrive at night, ask the driver to confirm the plate and name before you leave the station. Keep your valuables with you and share your live location with the hotel on the way.']], [['Is there a nearer station?', 'Sumerpur (Jawai Bandh) is about 18 km away and is served by fewer trains.'], ['Can the hotel arrange a taxi?', 'Yes. Share your timings and we will help.'], ['Are there night trains?', 'Several trains stop at night. Plan to rest and begin the safari the next morning.'], ['How long is the journey from Falna to Bera?', 'About 45 minutes by road.']], 'plan'],
    ['sumerpur-jawai-bandh-station-to-bera-transport', 'Sumerpur (Jawai Bandh) Station to Bera: Transport and Timing', 'Planning', 'jawai-bandh', 'The nearest railway station to Bera, about 18 km away, and how to complete the journey.', 'Sumerpur Jawai Bandh Station to Bera: Transport & Timing', 'Sumerpur (Jawai Bandh) station is the nearest station to Bera, about 18 km away. See how to get from the station to your hotel and plan arrival times.', 'Sumerpur station to Bera, Jawai Bandh railway station, nearest station Jawai, train Jawai, Sumerpur taxi', 'Sumerpur, station code JWB, is the closest railway station to Bera at about 18 km, or about 36 minutes by road.', [['Trains', 'Fewer trains stop here than at Falna, so check timetables carefully. Some travellers prefer Falna for its wider choice.'], ['Last-mile transport', 'A pre-arranged taxi is the simplest option. Tell us your arrival time and we will help.'], ['At night', 'If you arrive late, rest at the hotel and plan a safari for the next morning.'], ['Check the timetable', 'Because fewer trains stop at Sumerpur, check the timetable close to your date. If your preferred train does not stop here, Falna is the alternative.'], ['Combining with road travel', 'Some guests take the train to a larger station and drive the rest. Tell us your plan and we will suggest the simplest route.'], ['Planning your arrival', 'Arriving in daylight is easier, as the station is small and lighting is limited at night. Keep our team’s WhatsApp number saved and share your coach number so we can plan a pickup. Carry water and snacks in case your train runs late.']], [['How far is Sumerpur from Bera?', 'About 18 km, around 36 minutes.'], ['Which station is better, Sumerpur or Falna?', 'Sumerpur is nearer, Falna has more trains. Choose by timetable.'], ['Is there a taxi stand?', 'Availability varies. Pre-booking is safer.'], ['Can I leave luggage at the station?', 'Facilities are basic. It is better to go straight to the hotel.']], 'plan'