    ['udaipur-airport-to-jawai-transfer-guide', 'Udaipur Airport to Jawai: Transfer Guide', 'Planning', 'place-udaipur', 'The nearest major airport is about 129 km from Bera. Here is how the transfer works.', 'Udaipur Airport to Jawai & Bera: Transfer Guide', 'Flying to Jawai? Udaipur airport is about 129 km from Bera. See the drive time, taxi options, best arrival times and how to plan the first day.', 'Udaipur airport to Jawai, Udaipur to Bera, Jawai airport transfer, Maharana Pratap airport Jawai, fly to Jawai', 'Udaipur’s Maharana Pratap Airport is the nearest major airport to Bera, about 129 km, or around two hours by road.', [['Taxi transfer', 'Pre-book a car and tell us your flight time on [WhatsApp](contact). We can help with pickup suggestions.'], ['Best arrival times', 'Morning and afternoon flights work well. After dark, drive carefully, since livestock and village traffic are common.'], ['Make the first day easy', 'Arrive, rest, take a late-afternoon drive and a vegetarian dinner. Start fresh the next morning.'], ['What to expect on the road', 'National highways are good, with a few village sections. Plan a tea break halfway. Avoid driving at night if you can.'], ['Combining with Udaipur', 'Many guests spend a night in Udaipur first, then travel to Bera. See [Udaipur after Jawai](blog/udaipur-sightseeing-after-jawai-safari).'], ['What to pack for the drive', 'Carry water, a light snack, a phone charger and a jacket for the morning. Keep valuables with you and download offline maps because mobile signal weakens in hilly stretches. If you are arriving with children, a few small games make the two hours pass easily.']], [['How long is the drive?', 'About two hours.'], ['Can I fly into Jodhpur instead?', 'Yes. Jodhpur airport is about 173 km away.'], ['Can I rent a self-drive car?', 'Yes, but a driver reduces stress on unfamiliar roads.'], ['Can I stop on the way?', 'Yes. Tea and snack stops are available along the highway, and your driver can suggest a clean one.']], 'plan'],
    ['jodhpur-airport-to-jawai-transfer-guide', 'Jodhpur Airport to Jawai: Transfer Guide', 'Planning', 'place-jodhpur', 'About 173 km from Bera: the route, timing and how to plan an easy arrival.', 'Jodhpur Airport to Jawai & Bera: Transfer Guide', 'Flying into Jodhpur for Jawai? The airport is about 173 km from Bera. See the route, drive time, taxi tips and a simple plan for your first day.', 'Jodhpur airport to Jawai, Jodhpur to Bera, fly to Jodhpur Jawai, Jodhpur Jawai transfer, Jodhpur Jawai route', 'Jodhpur Airport is a good gateway if you plan to see the Blue City before or after Jawai. The drive to Bera is about 173 km.', [['The route', 'Roads are good and the drive takes roughly two and a half hours. Break the journey with tea in a roadside town.'], ['Combining with Jodhpur', 'Many guests spend a night in Jodhpur, then drive to Bera. See [Jodhpur from Jawai](blog/jodhpur-mehrangarh-fort-and-blue-city-from-jawai).'], ['Arranging the car', 'Book a car in advance and share your flight details on WhatsApp.'], ['Along the way', 'Roadside stops offer tea and simple snacks. Fill up fuel before leaving the city if you self-drive.'], ['Which side first?', 'Many travellers do Jodhpur, then Jawai, then Udaipur, or the reverse. Choose based on flight timings and the pace you want.'], ['Making the day easy', 'If you land in the morning, you can reach Bera by early afternoon, rest and take an evening drive. Flights landing late are better handled with a night in Jodhpur, so the road is not rushed after dark. Share your flight number with us so we can plan around delays.']], [['How far is Jodhpur Airport from Bera?', 'About 173 km.'], ['Is it better to land in Udaipur?', 'Udaipur is closer, about 129 km, but Jodhpur works well on a longer Rajasthan trip.'], ['Is the drive tiring?', 'It is comfortable if you take a break and start in the morning.'], ['Is there a direct bus?', 'Buses run on the main highway, but a car is much easier for the last stretch to Bera.']], 'plan']